 now the draw code finds the max value of the sample range in that data location and draws it.\n+\t//\n+\t// This way the graph never hides performance spikes from the user.","path":"editor/debugger/editor_profiler.cpp","commit_id":"34909555d28aef28fc6b42806d6a54aff54026b5","original_commit_id":"34909555d28aef28fc6b42806d6a54aff54026b5","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I didn't mean just remove the reference to the issue, but that this description is unnecessary ","created_at":"2026-03-23T15:21:06Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T15:21:07Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117066#discussion_r2975747905","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117066","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2975747905"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117066#discussion_r2975747905"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117066"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.git